.TH FLIP 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Flip \- How to mirror an image when drawing it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtypes.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef enum Flip {
  FLIP_NONE = SDL_FLIP_NONE,
  FLIP_H    = SDL_FLIP_HORIZONTAL,
  FLIP_V    = SDL_FLIP_VERTICAL,
} Flip;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
How to mirror an image when drawing it. Combine with | for both axes (FLIP_H | FLIP_V). Flipping happens about the destination rectangle's center, after rotation.
.SH VALUES
.TP
.B FLIP_NONE
draw as stored
.TP
.B FLIP_H
mirror left\-right (a right\-facing sprite faces left)
.TP
.B FLIP_V
mirror top\-bottom
.SH MODULE
types (src/engine/types/types.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR draw_texture_ex (3),
